{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t石排灣道香港仔漁業及海事分署早上10時許發生工業意外，兩名工人懷疑在吊臂車工作期間從約3層樓高位置墮下，兩人送往瑪麗醫院救治。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n兩名工人頭部受傷，其中約62歲男傷者一度昏迷，約57歲女傷者清醒，警方正調查事故成因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:26.035602+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:06:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:36.823479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:29.098996+00:00","content_hash":"a9ab7f4416005555274f5c990020db2ba5cb8d6b4faf435beb1d266ebc314c92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}